# The licensing reason this file used to exist is GONE.
#
# It previously ignored audio outright because every candidate was free-tier
# Suno output, licensed for personal and non-commercial use only, and this
# repository is PUBLIC - pushing one would have been distributing it. The tracks
# here now are paid-tier Output generated 2026-09-02 and cleared to ship
# (ASSET_LICENCES.md), so MP3s are tracked normally and `git add -f` is no longer
# needed for the bed.
#
# WAV IS STILL IGNORED, for a different reason: masters belong in
# the repo-root audio-masters/, outside the app entirely. Anything in static/ is copied wholesale
# into the build, so a 90 MB WAV here would be handed to every player. If a WAV
# appears in this directory it is in the wrong place, not merely uncommitted.
#
# BEFORE COMMITTING: only ONE track ships. Four are here while they are being
# auditioned, which is 26 MB to deliver 6.4 MB. Delete the three the
# ACTIVE_TRACK_ID does not name - and their ASSET_LICENCES.md rows - before
# staging, because git history does not forget: removing a file later takes a
# history rewrite, not a delete commit, and any fork or clone keeps its copy.
*.wav
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.webm
